[2026-03-15T01:03:23.053Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QDo1SBnKL1q33ruuN945C1","type":"tool_result","content":"547:### Component: ReviewsSection\n548-\n549-#### Test: Reviews section displays average ratings by category\n550-- **Initial state:** User navigates to `/properties/:id` for a property with multiple reviews. The average ratings are: cleanliness 4.5, accuracy 4.2, communication 4.8, location 4.6, value 4.0.\n551-- **Expected:** The reviews section shows a summary with average ratings for each category: \"Cleanliness: 4.5\", \"Accuracy: 4.2\", \"Communication: 4.8\", \"Location: 4.6\", \"Value: 4.0\". Each rating is displayed with a star icon or progress bar. An overall average rating is also displayed.\n552-\n553-#### Test: Reviews section displays overall average rating and total review count\n554-- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page with 15 reviews and an overall average rating of 4.3.\n555-- **Expected:** The reviews section header shows a star icon with \"4.3\" and \"15 reviews\" (or similar format like \"4.3 · 15 reviews\").\n556-\n557-#### Test: Reviews section displays individual review cards\n558-- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page with reviews. A review exists from guest \"Alice\" dated \"2026-01-15\" with rating 5 and comment \"Amazing place, loved every minute!\".\n559-- **Expected:** An individual review card is displayed showing the guest name \"Alice\", the date \"January 2026\" (or similar formatted date), a star rating of 5, and the comment text \"Amazing place, loved every minute!\".\n560-\n561-#### Test: Review cards display guest avatar or initial\n562-- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page with reviews. A reviewer has an avatar_url set, another reviewer does not.\n563-- **Expected:** Review cards show the guest's avatar image when available. When no avatar is set, a placeholder (e.g., first initial in a circle) is displayed.\n564-\n565-#### Test: Reviews section shows message when property has no reviews\n566-- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page for a property with no reviews.\n567-- **Expected:** The reviews section displays a message like \"No reviews yet\" instead of an empty review list. Category average ratings are not shown.\n568-\n569-#### Test: Reviews section handles pagination or \"Show more\" for many reviews\n570-- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page with more than 6 reviews.\n571-- **Expected:** An initial subset of reviews is displayed (e.g., 6 reviews). A \"Show all X reviews\" button is visible at the bottom (where X is the total count).\n572-\n573-#### Test: Clicking \"Show all reviews\" reveals all review cards\n574-- **Initial state:** User is on a property detail page with more than 6 reviews and a \"Show all X reviews\" button visible.\n575-- **Action:** User clicks \"Show all X reviews\".\n576-- **Expected:** All review cards are displayed. The button disappears or changes to \"Show less\".\n577-\n578-#### Test: Reviews are ordered by most recent first\n579-- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page with multiple reviews created on different dates.\n580-- **Expected:** Review cards are displayed in reverse chronological order, with the most recently created review appearing first.\n581-\n582-### Component: HostInfoCard\n583-\n584-#### Test: Host info card displays host name, avatar, bio, and member since date\n585-- **Initial state:** User navigates to `/properties/:id`. The property host has name \"Jane Host\", an avatar_url, bio \"Superhostess who loves sharing her properties\", and created_at \"2023-06-15\".\n586-- **Expected:** The host info card displays: the host's avatar image, name \"Jane Host\", bio text \"Superhostess who loves sharing her properties\", and \"Member since June 2023\" (formatted from created_at).\n587-\n588-#### Test: Host info card displays number of listings\n589-- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page. The host has 5 active property listings.\n590-- **Expected:** The host info card shows \"5 listings\" (or similar format like \"5 properties\").\n591-\n592-#### Test: Host info card shows placeholder avatar when host has no avatar\n593-- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page. The host has avatar_url set to null.\n594-- **Expected:** A placeholder avatar (e.g., first initial in a circle or a generic person icon) is displayed instead of a broken image.\n595-\n596-#### Test: Host info card displays correctly when host has no bio\n597-- **Initial state:** User navigates to a property detail page. The host has bio set to null.\n598-- **Expected:** The host info card displays the host name, avatar, and member since date. The bio area is either not shown or displays a default message. No empty or broken layout.\n599-\n600-## Page: My Trips (`/trips`)\n601-\n602-<!-- Components: TripsTabs, TripCard, CancelBookingDialog -->\n603-\n604-### Component: TripsTabs\n605-\n606-#### Test: My Trips page requires login\n607-- **Initial state:** User is not logged in.\n608-- **Action:** User navigates to `/trips`.\n609-- **Expected:** The user is redirected to the login page (`/login`). The My Trips page content is not displayed.\n610-\n611-#### Test: My Trips page defaults to Upcoming tab\n612-- **Initial state:** User is logged in and navigates to `/trips`.\n613-- **Expected:** The page displays three tabs: \"Upcoming\", \"Past\", and \"Cancelled\". The \"Upcoming\" tab is selected/highlighted by default. The content area shows upcoming trips (bookings with status \"pending\" or \"confirmed\" and check_in date >= today).\n614-\n615-#### Test: Upcoming tab shows pending and confirmed future bookings\n616-- **Initial state:** User is logged in with bookings: a confirmed booking checking in next week, a pending booking checking in next month, a completed booking from last month, and a cancelled booking.\n617-- **Action:** User is on the \"Upcoming\" tab.\n618-- **Expected:** Only the confirmed and pending future bookings are displayed. Completed and cancelled bookings are not shown in this tab.\n619-\n620-#### Test: Switching to Past tab shows completed bookings\n621-- **Initial state:** User is logged in and on the My Trips page with the \"Upcoming\" tab selected. The user has completed bookings.\n622-- **Action:** User clicks the \"Past\" tab.\n623-- **Expected:** The \"Past\" tab becomes selected/highlighted. The content area updates to show only bookings with status \"completed\". Upcoming and cancelled bookings are not shown.\n624-\n625-#### Test: Switching to Cancelled tab shows cancelled bookings\n626-- **Initial state:** User is logged in and on the My Trips page with the \"Upcoming\" tab selected. The user has cancelled bookings.\n627-- **Action:** User clicks the \"Cancelled\" tab.\n628-- **Expected:** The \"Cancelled\" tab becomes selected/highlighted. The content area updates to show only bookings with status \"cancelled\". Upcoming and completed bookings are not shown.\n629-\n630-#### Test: Switching back to Upcoming tab from another tab\n631-- **Initial state:** User is on the My Trips page with the \"Past\" tab selected.\n632-- **Action:** User clicks the \"Upcoming\" tab.\n633-- **Expected:** The \"Upcoming\" tab becomes selected/highlighted. The content area updates to show upcoming bookings again.\n634-\n635-#### Test: Tab shows empty state when no bookings exist for that category\n636-- **Initial state:** User is logged in with no completed bookings.\n637-- **Action:** User clicks the \"Past\" tab.\n638-- **Expected:** The \"Past\" tab content area displays a message like \"No past trips\" or \"You don't have any past trips yet.\" instead of an empty list.\n639-\n640-#### Test: Upcoming tab empty state message\n641-- **Initial state:** User is logged in with no pending or confirmed future bookings.\n642-- **Action:** User views the \"Upcoming\" 