n---\n\n### Data Flow\n\nThe complete flow for fetching and displaying reviews:\n\n1. **Property Detail Page** (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/PropertyDetail.tsx`) calls `fetchPropertyDetail(id)`\n2. **propertyDetailSlice** makes a GET request to `/api/properties/{propertyId}`\n3. **properties.ts endpoint** (lines 40-46) fetches reviews for that property and returns them as part of the property object\n4. **PropertyDetail** component passes `property.reviews` to `ReviewsSection` component (line 72)\n5. **ReviewsSection** component renders the reviews with aggregated statistics and individual review cards"}],"totalDurationMs":22103,"totalTokens":36986,"totalToolUseCount":14,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4123,"cache_read_input_tokens":31828,"output_tokens":1033,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4123},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}}}
