ngs with pending status even after deleting reviews, and test 8's bookings overlap with those dates. The simplest solution is to extend the cleanup function to also delete bookings for the property, not just reviews.\n\nActually, I could sidestep this entirely by using dates that don't conflict with previous tests—shifting test 8 to use October and November 2026 instead of January and February 2025 would avoid any overlap with the earlier test data.\n\nBut the cleaner approach is to add a cleanup function that removes all bookings for the property before each test runs, ensuring a fresh state regardless of what prior tests created.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3721,"cache_read_input_tokens":62118,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3721,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6b915d7b-b9f5-4445-990b-d343040d58c6","uuid":"82eec0b9-355b-45d1-87a4-9d8ac2f10906"}
